{"id":"n87083-1-9","stage":3,"title":"활기 · 朝气","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87083-1-9-1","ko":"아이가 태어나니까 집안 분위기가 밝아진 것 같아.","zh":"孩子出生后，家里的气氛似乎变得明亮起来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이가","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이가","audio":"/audio/820c647554b7d3f4fc3a.mp3"}},{"text":"태어나니까","meaning":"诞生，出生，降生","explanation":"태어나다：诞生，出生，降生；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"태어나다","audio":"/audio/ecdb2b36d4c847de96f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72180","senseId":"1","lemma":"태어나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"태어나니까","audio":"/audio/0ecec7182d210c94c79d.mp3"}},{"text":"집안","meaning":"家庭","explanation":"집안：家庭","readings":[{"term":"집안","audio":"/audio/2474242906f4997ecb89.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71361","senseId":"1","lemma":"집안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집안","audio":"/audio/2474242906f4997ecb89.mp3"}},{"text":"분위기가","meaning":"气氛，氛围","explanation":"분위기：气氛，氛围；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"분위기","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65855","senseId":"1","lemma":"분위기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분위기가","audio":"/audio/aeafae1134479b98bf89.mp3"}},{"text":"밝아진","meaning":"开朗，明朗；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"밝다：开朗，明朗；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"밝다","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62105","senseId":"4","lemma":"밝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밝아진","audio":"/audio/d8531c761a16fe52fd88.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"ecdb2b36d4c847de","term":"태어나다","zh":"诞生，出生，降生","audio":"/audio/ecdb2b36d4c847de96f4.mp3","entryId":"72180","definition":"人或动物从母腹中出来。","pronunciation":["태어나다"]},{"id":"2474242906f4997e","term":"집안","zh":"家庭","audio":"/audio/2474242906f4997ecb89.mp3","entryId":"71361","definition":"以家人为成员生活的共同体；或指近亲。","pronunciation":["지반"]},{"id":"b0d7b29bb8fee646","term":"분위기","zh":"气氛，氛围","audio":"/audio/b0d7b29bb8fee6469928.mp3","entryId":"65855","definition":"在某个场合或场面获得的感受。","pronunciation":["부뉘기"]},{"id":"e97bef4d1c5d4c2f","term":"밝다","zh":"开朗，明朗","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3","entryId":"62105","definition":"表情，性格或气氛等愉快而活泼。","pronunciation":["박따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b2287dddd30cb96fa6d5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87083-1-9-2","ko":"맞아. 아이들이 있으니까 집안에 활기가 넘쳐.","zh":"没错。因为有孩子们在，家里充满了活力。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맞아.","meaning":"对","explanation":"맞다：对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아","audio":"/audio/c92874385c2bbee2ea2e.mp3"}},{"text":"아이들이","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이들이","audio":"/audio/ac32747784d62b1df40f.mp3"}},{"text":"있으니까","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으니까","audio":"/audio/29dd257269502abdc5be.mp3"}},{"text":"집안에","meaning":"家庭","explanation":"집안：家庭；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집안","audio":"/audio/2474242906f4997ecb89.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71361","senseId":"1","lemma":"집안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집안에","audio":"/audio/25ce6bbd643e75b02c5f.mp3"}},{"text":"활기가","meaning":"朝气，活力，生气，生机","explanation":"활기：朝气，活力，生气，生机；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"활기","audio":"/audio/6799f2448ad8c700b66f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87083","senseId":"1","lemma":"활기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"활기가","audio":"/audio/967bb94a128696f070ff.mp3"}},{"text":"넘쳐.","meaning":"洋溢，充满","explanation":"넘치다：洋溢，充满；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"넘치다","audio":"/audio/c2c9d6